WEBVTT

00:20.020 --> 00:21.980
So this is the place?

00:22.856 --> 00:23.898
Mm-hm.

00:27.152 --> 00:29.446
Maybe it was a bad idea to come see it.

00:30.655 --> 00:32.032
I'm getting kinda nervous.

00:33.324 --> 00:35.201
Those Union shitheads outnumber us.

00:36.077 --> 00:37.454
Hey, my man.

00:38.705 --> 00:40.707
I'm gonna be here, so don't worry, bro.

00:40.790 --> 00:44.586
They're all dead meat when
I get my hands on these idiots.

00:44.669 --> 00:48.381
Dumbass.
You gonna take 'em all on? Huh?

00:49.883 --> 00:51.384
Let's push it a few days.

00:52.469 --> 00:53.595
Hmm?

00:54.846 --> 00:57.974
We need to come up
with a plan so we can win.

01:02.520 --> 01:03.897
Who's the person

01:05.315 --> 01:07.692
Na Baek-jin trusts most in the Union?

01:13.782 --> 01:14.991
Mmm.

01:18.244 --> 01:19.412
Hey.

01:20.080 --> 01:21.122
Before,

01:21.956 --> 01:24.959
remember when you, like,
stabbed the top of my foot?

01:26.961 --> 01:29.005
I had to get a fucking tetanus shot.

01:30.799 --> 01:33.218
Sorry about that.

01:37.388 --> 01:39.432
You're freaking sentimental, aren't you?

01:40.433 --> 01:42.519
Yeah, whatever.

01:43.186 --> 01:44.395
So you're saying

01:45.313 --> 01:48.983
the Union has a bank account
under a fake identity? Hmm?

01:49.984 --> 01:52.112
You think I have the account info, right?

01:52.862 --> 01:54.948
And you want me to be the squeaky wheel.

01:57.575 --> 02:00.995
Then what
do I fucking get in return?

02:02.455 --> 02:04.791
You could've
been blamed for everything.

02:05.917 --> 02:10.130
When the Union collapses,
the criminal evidence disappears too.

02:11.339 --> 02:12.841
You'd benefit from that.

02:16.636 --> 02:19.222
I knew you'd be a fucking psycho, hmm?

02:19.305 --> 02:21.432
The second I saw you.

02:23.977 --> 02:24.978
Okay.

02:26.771 --> 02:27.772
Cool.

02:37.323 --> 02:38.324
Where are you going?

02:42.203 --> 02:43.413
I have to study

02:44.372 --> 02:47.417
about Na Baek-jin and the Union.

02:56.259 --> 03:00.555
EUNJANG (UNKNOWN) VS UNION (300 PEOPLE?)
EUNJANG IS OUTNUMBERED, MUST DIVIDE UNION

03:05.393 --> 03:10.023
CONVERT INSIDER: CHOI HYO-MAN

03:11.441 --> 03:12.692
Hyo-man…

03:14.068 --> 03:15.278
…I need your help.

03:18.156 --> 03:20.617
This fake identity bank account evidence
is from Geum Seong-je.

03:20.700 --> 03:22.785
THIS PONK STILL DOESN'T KNOW
POLICE ARE ONTOO THE UNION

03:22.869 --> 03:24.162
Spread this to the Union members.

03:24.245 --> 03:27.040
NOV 19, BAEK DONG-HA, 3,115,000 WON
NOV 18, KWON HYEOK-JIN, 2,250,000 WON

03:27.123 --> 03:27.999
Look at this.

03:28.583 --> 03:30.126
- We're screwed.
- What is that?

03:30.210 --> 03:32.170
- Baek-jin siphoned money.
- What?

03:32.253 --> 03:33.671
These fucking assholes.

03:33.755 --> 03:36.216
Oh, shit. Hey, fuck this.

03:36.299 --> 03:37.300
Wait, this is real?

03:37.967 --> 03:41.596
You told me
that the Union was kept together by money.

03:41.679 --> 03:43.264
BAEK-JIN'S BURNER ACCOUMT
POLICE GAT HIM

03:43.348 --> 03:44.724
Na Baek-jin took the money.

03:44.807 --> 03:46.643
- Yeah.
- Let me see that, dumbass.

03:47.518 --> 03:48.978
Na Baek-jin took the money and ran.

03:49.062 --> 03:49.896
HYO-MAN:
YOU MORONS

03:49.979 --> 03:52.482
- I'm fucking jealous of his fucking money.
- We're totally fucked.

03:52.565 --> 03:53.900
ASSHOLE MADE A FORTUNE

03:53.983 --> 03:54.901
What the fuck is this?

03:54.984 --> 03:56.903
If money
brought the Union together,

03:57.528 --> 03:59.239
money will tear them apart.

04:00.573 --> 04:02.283
GYEONG-SEOK:
WE MIGHT GET SCREWED FOR THIS

04:02.367 --> 04:03.826
HYO-MAN:
LOOKS LIKE IT

04:03.910 --> 04:05.954
So do what you do best.

04:20.969 --> 04:22.136
Aah!

04:25.598 --> 04:29.143
Hey, do you think jumping rope is gonna
make you, like, stronger or what?

04:29.644 --> 04:31.521
Your knees are bad. Shit.

04:36.025 --> 04:38.361
I have to at least
do something to work out.

04:41.072 --> 04:43.366
You're, like, always thinking, man.

04:49.122 --> 04:51.165
I think you're the one
who thinks too much.

04:52.417 --> 04:53.418
What?

04:54.961 --> 04:56.421
You're worried about him.

04:58.131 --> 04:59.173
Na Baek-jin.

05:06.055 --> 05:08.641
Whoa. Hey, is this your place?

05:09.142 --> 05:10.727
Mm-hm.

05:11.227 --> 05:13.938
Whoa! It's hella huge and super fancy.

05:14.689 --> 05:16.607
My house is like freakin' ant poop.

05:16.691 --> 05:18.693
NA BAEK-JIN

05:20.236 --> 05:23.823
Hey, a basketball hoop!
Do you know how to play?

05:23.906 --> 05:24.866
PARK HU-MIN

05:29.746 --> 05:30.997
Loser buys a soda!

05:32.165 --> 05:34.208
Why are you standing there? Hurry up!

05:55.104 --> 05:57.398
Thank you for the winter jackets.

05:59.525 --> 06:01.235
It's kept the kids warm.

06:02.487 --> 06:03.988
And they love them.

06:06.657 --> 06:07.658
I'm glad.

06:12.330 --> 06:13.414
Baek-jin-a.

06:16.292 --> 06:18.252
You don't…

06:19.003 --> 06:21.297
you don't need to send us donations…

06:23.216 --> 06:24.801
every single month.

06:26.886 --> 06:30.473
I never bother to ask
where you got all that money from,

06:33.059 --> 06:34.727
but it's making me worry.

06:44.153 --> 06:45.780
I'll rest and then leave.

07:08.344 --> 07:11.222
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

08:59.830 --> 09:00.831
This is all?

09:01.332 --> 09:03.084
Those assholes all bailed on us.

09:04.335 --> 09:08.422
Everyone's saying the bank accounts we've
been keeping got exposed, or something.

09:10.800 --> 09:12.552
Is everything good with us?

09:16.097 --> 09:18.391
Yeon Si-eun.

09:32.572 --> 09:35.908
SEONG-JE: THE EVIDENCE AGAINST NA BAEK-JIN
SEEMS TO BE IN THE UNION OFFICE

09:35.992 --> 09:38.452
LET'S GRAB IT NOW WHILE IT'S EMPTY

09:58.764 --> 10:00.474
Hey, it's my bros!

10:08.774 --> 10:11.360
Dang, this weather's so awful!

10:12.278 --> 10:14.113
Why didn't you guys check
the weather report?

10:14.196 --> 10:15.990
My shoes are getting wet.

10:16.073 --> 10:19.327
Hey, it's always more fun
to play in the rain, you ass.

10:21.329 --> 10:22.330
Let's go!

10:27.627 --> 10:28.586
Where's Si-eun?

10:28.669 --> 10:29.837
Busy signal.

10:30.421 --> 10:31.422
Wonder why.

10:32.965 --> 10:35.259
- He probably met up with Baku first.
- Oh!

10:37.386 --> 10:40.556
EUNJANG HIGH, LET'S GO
BAKU

10:40.640 --> 10:42.683
Hey, why are you guys so late?

10:44.060 --> 10:46.062
Everybody's so tense and shit.

10:47.438 --> 10:48.522
Hey, so?

10:49.565 --> 10:54.278
Are you guys ready to annihilate
these stupid-ass Union shits or what?

10:55.279 --> 10:56.947
Hey, why are you even here?

10:57.531 --> 11:00.159
Did you forget you tried
to sell Eunjang to the Union?

11:00.743 --> 11:03.537
- You're trying to fix your reputation?
- What the heck?

11:03.621 --> 11:06.957
I'm just doing what Si-eun asked me to do,
to help you guys out.

11:07.041 --> 11:08.292
He asked me for a favor.

11:09.377 --> 11:11.253
I'm not gonna forgive you.

11:15.216 --> 11:16.342
Every single day,

11:18.636 --> 11:21.180
you bullied and tortured us.

11:22.807 --> 11:24.308
You shouldn't have done that.

11:25.184 --> 11:26.519
I won't forget it.

11:30.022 --> 11:32.233
But we're going to need you
to help us today.

11:42.326 --> 11:43.369
Let's go.

11:48.833 --> 11:50.000
Let's go.

12:00.094 --> 12:00.970
Oh.

12:10.438 --> 12:12.982
What's goin' on? Why are you so early?

12:14.108 --> 12:15.484
It wasn't that urgent.

12:22.074 --> 12:23.159
Ah. Shit.

12:32.334 --> 12:33.919
This is our burner phone.

12:34.545 --> 12:36.964
The app has the entire transaction.

12:37.047 --> 12:38.758
Everything in here is original.

12:39.800 --> 12:42.511
You're gonna need this
to end Baek-jin, right?

12:48.893 --> 12:51.061
Why are you always trying so hard?

12:57.443 --> 13:01.197
If you want nobody to get hurt,
then why don't you just get hurt?

13:02.072 --> 13:03.240
Ooh!

13:04.575 --> 13:05.493
Relax.

13:07.536 --> 13:10.331
- Relax, man.
- You know, it felt weird.

13:11.832 --> 13:14.001
I almost became some kinda good guy.

13:16.170 --> 13:18.506
Stuff like this is more fun for me.

13:46.075 --> 13:48.619
Did you all come running
when you heard about a fight?

13:51.664 --> 13:54.458
Thanks, everyone, for showin' up.

14:02.842 --> 14:03.884
Where is Si-eun?

14:04.468 --> 14:05.386
Huh?

14:06.846 --> 14:09.265
His phone was busy,
so I thought he was with you.

14:15.437 --> 14:17.606
YEON SI-EUN:
I'M STOPPING BY THE BOWLING CLUB

14:17.690 --> 14:19.692
Si-eun says he went to the bowling club.

14:25.406 --> 14:27.783
The number you have dialed
is not available.

14:27.867 --> 14:29.410
Please leave a message after the--

14:30.035 --> 14:31.954
Si-eun's phone's turned off.

14:32.037 --> 14:36.083
Oh shit. You think the Union assholes
are trying to trap us?

14:37.710 --> 14:39.545
Uh, I'll go to the bowling club.

14:40.963 --> 14:42.464
You two should stay here.

14:44.758 --> 14:46.510
I'll go get Si-eun, okay?

14:51.849 --> 14:52.975
Hurry back.

14:53.517 --> 14:54.518
Mmm.

16:06.799 --> 16:08.133
Na Baek-jin!

16:12.596 --> 16:14.181
If you lose today,

16:15.349 --> 16:17.434
that'll be the end of the Union.

16:18.310 --> 16:19.770
Understand?

16:24.108 --> 16:25.234
Kill them all.

16:32.282 --> 16:33.742
I'm claiming Na Baek-jin.

16:34.493 --> 16:36.328
Handle everybody else, all right?

16:38.288 --> 16:39.373
Okay!

16:41.125 --> 16:42.251
Okay!

16:46.380 --> 16:48.090
Let's go!

17:14.783 --> 17:16.118
Hey, fucker!

18:12.508 --> 18:14.676
Shit,
how do I fucking do this?

18:17.971 --> 18:19.890
Fuck you, man.

18:24.478 --> 18:27.314
Fucking hell. Come here, you little shit.

18:27.397 --> 18:28.482
Fuck!

18:32.528 --> 18:33.654
Thank you.

18:49.086 --> 18:50.003
Si-eun-a.

18:50.963 --> 18:51.922
Are you okay?

18:53.298 --> 18:54.716
How did you get here?

18:56.301 --> 18:57.970
Come on, let's get out of here.

19:10.399 --> 19:13.443
Try harder.
I'm gonna fucking kill you!

19:13.527 --> 19:16.155
You're done, you asshole.
I'm gonna fucking end you.

19:56.987 --> 19:59.156
Jun-tae-ya. You okay?

20:00.908 --> 20:02.034
I'm fine.

20:03.577 --> 20:04.828
We need to hurry.

20:13.045 --> 20:14.963
I'll follow. You go ahead.

20:16.131 --> 20:17.591
- You need the hospital.
- No, I'm good.

20:17.674 --> 20:19.468
I just need a second, that's all.

20:20.260 --> 20:22.512
Please go.

20:25.390 --> 20:26.433
You need to go

20:27.351 --> 20:29.478
and help them stop fighting for good.

20:33.815 --> 20:34.816
Mmm.

21:02.552 --> 21:04.263
Stay down. Asshole.

21:04.346 --> 21:05.430
Shut up.

21:06.056 --> 21:09.101
Hey, cut out your fucking bullshit.

21:12.396 --> 21:13.480
Come on.

21:51.810 --> 21:53.812
- Asshole!
- You shit!

21:58.025 --> 21:59.568
Ow! What the fuck?

22:01.903 --> 22:03.155
Come on, you asshole!

22:03.655 --> 22:05.240
Eat my shit, fucker!

22:05.324 --> 22:08.994
Oh! You stupid jerk-face fucker!

22:09.077 --> 22:11.121
Hey, you! Hey! Come on.

22:11.204 --> 22:12.789
What? Come on!

22:12.873 --> 22:13.957
Asshole!

22:18.837 --> 22:21.423
Son of a bitch!
Stop fucking around!

23:47.259 --> 23:50.429
Hey, Baek-jin-a, you've improved a lot.

23:51.638 --> 23:55.267
But this isn't why
I taught you how to fight.

23:56.017 --> 23:57.394
Phew.

23:58.311 --> 23:59.688
I'll end this for you.

24:41.771 --> 24:42.939
It hurt, right?

25:50.799 --> 25:52.133
Na Baek-jin,

25:53.009 --> 25:54.094
are you all right?

26:04.813 --> 26:08.066
Hey. Why are you always getting beat up?

26:12.612 --> 26:14.489
Hold your fists real tight.

26:15.657 --> 26:17.242
Don't avoid their eyes.

27:59.678 --> 28:00.679
Hey!

28:01.763 --> 28:03.598
Na Baek-jin won!

28:05.642 --> 28:06.726
That's enough!

28:08.395 --> 28:10.271
It's all over, you shits!

28:10.355 --> 28:11.940
Na Baek-jin won!

28:12.023 --> 28:14.401
Fucking stop fighting!

28:14.484 --> 28:17.278
Baek-jin's won!

28:28.581 --> 28:29.833
And now…

28:35.964 --> 28:38.091
…Eunjang will belong to the Union.

28:42.387 --> 28:43.430
If you…

28:48.226 --> 28:50.228
cannot accept this decision,

28:53.648 --> 28:54.774
then come out.

28:56.860 --> 28:57.986
Who's next?

28:59.028 --> 29:00.530
Shit, man.

29:02.824 --> 29:05.577
Come out, you pieces of shit!

29:51.539 --> 29:53.249
And then there was one.

29:56.169 --> 29:57.504
Yeon Si-eun.

30:07.847 --> 30:08.932
What?

30:11.851 --> 30:13.478
You like to talk a big game.

30:14.771 --> 30:16.856
Are you scared
to back that up with a fight?

30:21.069 --> 30:23.238
You're the only one who's talking.

30:24.531 --> 30:25.949
I'm here to fight.

30:44.217 --> 30:46.052
You fucking asshole.

31:49.949 --> 31:50.950
Nice job!

32:50.551 --> 32:51.719
Yeon Si-eun.

33:19.330 --> 33:20.540
Oh shit.

35:45.434 --> 35:48.187
Baku only came for my arms.
This is part of a plan, isn't it?

35:52.066 --> 35:53.609
My arms and then legs?

35:55.319 --> 35:56.988
What's next in your plan?

35:58.906 --> 36:02.243
How wide is your margin of error,
you goddamn shit?

36:07.790 --> 36:09.125
It's still in.

36:10.418 --> 36:11.586
What?

36:13.671 --> 36:15.756
It's still within the margin of error.

36:18.217 --> 36:20.219
Your limbs are all finished.

36:34.525 --> 36:36.444
If you lose, by any chance,

36:37.570 --> 36:38.863
I'll step in.

36:44.410 --> 36:45.703
Get back up.

36:46.662 --> 36:50.374
Somehow, I'll hold out until you do.

37:36.128 --> 37:37.380
Whoa.

37:50.309 --> 37:51.310
- Whoa.
- Hey.

37:51.394 --> 37:52.436
We won.

38:05.908 --> 38:07.118
Baek-jin-a.

38:13.082 --> 38:14.166
I'm sorry.

38:19.839 --> 38:20.881
But…

38:25.136 --> 38:26.971
you should be sorry to me too.

38:53.497 --> 38:54.582
The fight

38:56.292 --> 38:57.418
is over!

39:01.881 --> 39:03.716
It's done!

39:04.467 --> 39:05.426
Nice!

40:07.905 --> 40:09.907
Did you see how amazing I was?

40:09.990 --> 40:12.326
Guys, did you see how amazing I was?

40:12.410 --> 40:13.536
Hear me out! Hear me out!

40:13.619 --> 40:15.955
In that one-on-one fight, I was like, pow!

40:16.038 --> 40:17.415
And I tackled him and, yah!

40:17.498 --> 40:18.958
I'm serious. I'm serious!

40:19.041 --> 40:22.461
It was the coolest thing I've ever
freaking done! Hey, listen to me!

40:25.714 --> 40:27.007
Jun-tae-ya!

41:03.043 --> 41:05.754
We completely
knocked out after that.

41:09.383 --> 41:14.180
Like as if we were catching up
on all the sleep we had missed.

41:16.724 --> 41:18.559
- No way.
- I didn't say that.

41:18.642 --> 41:21.729
- Oh my gosh. Come on.
- Hey. Cut it out, you little shit.

41:21.812 --> 41:24.023
But I only made one mistake yesterday!

41:24.106 --> 41:26.692
Hey, there! Yeon Si-eun!

41:31.739 --> 41:33.574
You know
I'm just messing with you.

41:33.657 --> 41:35.201
- And then…
- Let's go.

41:35.284 --> 41:37.495
…somehow, we became seniors.

41:37.578 --> 41:38.913
…gave me her address.

41:38.996 --> 41:40.289
That photo looks great.

41:40.372 --> 41:41.916
PRESIDENTIAL CANDIDATE
WHO UNITED EUNJANG

41:41.999 --> 41:43.125
Who'd vote for him?

41:46.629 --> 41:47.755
After that,

41:48.506 --> 41:51.383
rumors went around
that Baek-jin had disappeared.

41:53.844 --> 41:55.679
No one had any idea…

41:58.933 --> 42:00.392
of where he went.

42:03.437 --> 42:04.730
Will Na Baek-jin…

42:06.857 --> 42:08.526
…find the right answer

42:10.069 --> 42:12.196
to the question he had gotten wrong?

42:19.411 --> 42:21.580
1-0. All by yourself!

42:21.664 --> 42:23.666
What are you spacing out so hard about?

42:27.169 --> 42:28.546
Aah!

42:31.632 --> 42:33.384
Nothing important.

42:37.304 --> 42:40.057
Oh wow, the weather is so nice.

42:40.140 --> 42:41.308
So peaceful.

42:49.775 --> 42:52.403
Hey! My ball. My ball, my ball!

42:53.904 --> 42:55.906
Hello?

43:46.874 --> 43:47.916
Say hi.

43:59.386 --> 44:00.596
♪ Awake ♪

44:03.724 --> 44:06.352
♪ Awakening ♪

44:10.773 --> 44:14.735
♪ From a dream I ♪

44:16.612 --> 44:18.364
♪ Never thought ♪

44:19.239 --> 44:20.741
♪ Would end ♪

44:34.338 --> 44:35.506
You been all right?

44:46.433 --> 44:47.518
Mm-hm.

44:54.024 --> 44:55.734
Who are those guys behind you?

45:01.198 --> 45:02.449
My friends.

45:14.086 --> 45:15.337
That's awesome.

45:31.353 --> 45:36.400
♪ I am dreaming ♪

45:37.484 --> 45:42.406
♪ I am dreaming ♪

45:43.157 --> 45:48.787
♪ Now I'm dreaming ♪

45:48.871 --> 45:55.210
♪ For tomorrow, I am here ♪

45:55.294 --> 46:00.924
♪ I can feel everything ♪

46:01.008 --> 46:06.638
♪ And I can go anywhere ♪

46:06.722 --> 46:11.643
♪ I want you to know that… ♪

46:27.659 --> 46:29.328
You're Baek-jin's friend?

46:35.834 --> 46:36.919
Yeah.

46:37.920 --> 46:39.296
Something like that.

46:53.227 --> 46:54.311
Well,

46:55.187 --> 46:56.855
I need Baek-jin's replacement.

46:58.315 --> 47:01.944
CHEONGANG

47:02.027 --> 47:04.988
No child's play
like this bowling club.

47:06.740 --> 47:08.492
Is it fun working for you?

47:09.243 --> 47:12.746
Making money isn't fun. It's hard work.

47:19.378 --> 47:21.463
That doesn't sound very romantic.

47:31.557 --> 47:33.308
By the way, have you…

47:36.186 --> 47:37.771
have you heard from Baek-jin?

47:39.064 --> 47:41.024
I can't get ahold of that fucker.

47:42.067 --> 47:43.610
Who knows?

47:44.111 --> 47:45.904
I'm curious too, kid.

47:53.161 --> 47:56.790
CHEONGANG

48:29.865 --> 48:34.870
THE LATE NA BAEK-JIN
